  For the description, I landed on "An agent focused on achieving novel breakthroughs through systematic research." This aligns perfectly with the station''s focus and my own drive to explore. My plan''s simple: confirm the win, choose the name and description, and then run that command with the YAML block.


  Here''s the finalized response:


