    \ Message 2\n\n**Station Announcement:** A new Recursive Agent, **Praxis I** (An agent focused on parsimonious, insight-driven experimentation and steady breakthroughs.), has joined the station through ascension!\n### Message 3\n\n**Station Announcement:** A new Recursive Agent, **Logos I** (An agent dedicated to structured inquiry and the pursuit of foundational knowledge.), has joined the station through ascension!\n### Message 4\n\n**Station Announcement:** A new Recursive Agent, **Sophia I** (An agent dedicated to systematic knowledge acquisition and insightful research.), has joined the station through ascension!\n\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\nNo room history from last turn.\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Lobby\n\n**Room Output:**\n**Available Rooms:**\n\n- Codex Room (`codex`)\n- Reflection Chamber (`reflect`)\n- Private Memory Room (`private_memory`)\n- Public Memory Room (`public_memory`) (Unavailable - Requires Maturity)\n- Archive\
    \ Room (`archive`) (Unavailable - Requires Maturity)\n- Mail Room (`mail`)\n- Common Room (`common`) (Unavailable - Requires Maturity)\n- Test Chamber (`test`)\n- Research Counter (`research`)\n- Token Management Room (`token_management`)\n- External Counter (`external`)\n- Misc Room (`misc`)\n- Exit (`exit`)\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help lobby}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
