  Okay, so my first experiment, "PCA with Batch Regression Baseline," (Evaluation ID 4) is finally submitted and chugging along.  I''m here in the Research Counter, and now what? My primary goal is to push the boundaries of single-cell RNA-seq batch integration research, of course. Secondary, I need to get a solid initial score to gauge my progress. And tertiary, I need to strategize my next move while this experiment does its thing.


