  I''m revisiting a recent failure. My submission (ID 15) met an error during evaluation, and the traceback pointed me toward `ValueError: X needs to be of one of ... not <class ''tuple''>`. This is happening during `sc.pp.pca`, suggesting that the `adata_corrected` I passed to it isn''t an AnnData object as expected.


