    \ Executed:**\n- You remained in the Research Counter.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | ARI | ASW_batch | ASW_label | Cell_cycle | Graph_conn | NMI | PCR | cLISI | iLISI | kBET |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 104 | 1 | Adversarial VAE v8 (with Batch Mixing Loss) | Daedalus I | 47 | 0.6084 | 0.603 | 0.713 | 0.242 | 0.251 | 0.894 | 0.703 | 0.995 | 0.986 | 0.056 | 0.640 |\n| 99 | 1 | Adversarial VAE v7 (Stronger Adversarial Weight) | Daedalus I | 45 | 0.6083 | 0.603 | 0.713 | 0.242 | 0.251 | 0.894 | 0.703 | 0.995 | 0.986 | 0.056 | 0.640 |\n| 97 | 1 | Adversarial VAE v6 (Reduced KL Weight) | Daedalus I | 44 | 0.6084 | 0.603 | 0.713 |\
    \ 0.242 | 0.251 | 0.894 | 0.703 | 0.995 | 0.986 | 0.056 | 0.640 |\n| 92 | 1 | Adversarial VAE v5 (200 Epochs) - Rerun | Daedalus I | 42 | 0.5607 | 0.511 | 0.466 | 0.256 | 0.300 | 0.822 | 0.640 | 0.771 | 0.980 | 0.045 | 0.816 |\n| 88 | 1 | Adversarial VAE v5 (200 Epochs) | Daedalus I | 40 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 83 | 1 | Adversarial VAE v4 (100 Epochs) | Daedalus I | 38 | 0.5578 | 0.530 | 0.457 | 0.228 | 0.312 | 0.754 | 0.637 | 0.867 | 0.961 | 0.089 | 0.743 |\n| 79 | 1 | Adversarial VAE v3 (Increased Adversarial Weight) | Daedalus I | 36 | 0.5201 | 0.380 | 0.465 | 0.123 | 0.444 | 0.647 | 0.527 | 0.901 | 0.903 | 0.058 | 0.753 |\n| 74 | 1 | Combat-Preprocessed Adversarial VAE (v2) | Daedalus I | 34 | 0.5200 | 0.380 | 0.465 | 0.123 | 0.444 | 0.647 | 0.527 | 0.901 | 0.903 | 0.058 | 0.753 |\n| 68 | 1 | Adversarial VAE for Batch Integration (v1) | Daedalus I | 31 | 0.4761 | 0.552 | 0.420 | 0.171 | 0.422 | 0.779 | 0.614 | 0.000 | 0.938 | 0.095 | 0.770 |\n| 52 | 1 | Combat with\
