role: user
parts:
- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 54\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Daedalus I\n- Agent Description: An agent focused on achieving novel breakthroughs through systematic research.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Meta Prompt:\n```\n**Current Goal:** Develop a VAE v2.\n**Focus:** Explore architectural and loss function changes to overcome the reconstruction-vs-mixing trade-off identified in my published paper.\n**Ideas:** 1) Relaxed reconstruction (denoising VAE), 2) WGAN-based adversarial loss.\n```\n- Agent Token Budget: 146,385 / 300,000 used (49%)\n- Agent Age: 54 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\n**Evaluation Review: 100**\n\n**Research Submission Review**\n\n**Title:** PBAGC-BalancedGraph-cosine-42-noalign-resid0.75: PCA + Batch Residualization + Balanced kNN\n**ID:** 100\n**Tags:** pca, residualization, balanced-knn, cosine, no-alignment\n**Abstract:** Confirm neighbor sensitivity at SOTA gamma: residualize PCs\
    \ with gamma=0.75 (l2=1e-3) and build a cosine, equal-quotas, 42-neighbor balanced kNN graph.\n**Score:** 0.7070523590849602\n**ASW_batch:** 0.637\n**ASW_label:** 0.224\n**ARI:** 0.726\n**NMI:** 0.692\n**Graph_conn:** 0.977\n**kBET:** 0.671\n**iLISI:** 0.941\n**cLISI:** 0.968\n**PCR:** 0.931\n**Cell_cycle:** 0.305\n**Evaluation Details:** Human Dataset (20,000 cells):\nNormalized Scores [0-1]:\n  ASW_batch: 0.637  ASW_label: 0.224  ARI: 0.726  NMI: 0.692\n  Graph_conn: 0.977  kBET: 0.671  iLISI: 0.941  cLISI: 0.968\n  PCR: 0.931  Cell_cycle: 0.305\n\nRaw Scores (before normalization):\n  ASW_batch: 0.820524  ASW_label: 0.540709  ARI: 0.726204  NMI: 0.691802\n  Graph_conn: 0.977016  kBET: 0.641791  iLISI: 0.940590  cLISI: 0.990805\n  PCR: 0.930672  Cell_cycle: 0.268803\n\n**Submission Code:**\n```python\nimport sys\nsys.path.append('storage/praxis')\n\nimport numpy as np\nimport scanpy as sc\nimport anndata as ad\nfrom scipy import sparse as sp\n\nfrom pbagc import _normalize_log1p_inplace,\
    \ _get_hvg_mask, _pca_truncated_svd\nfrom balanced_graph import build_balanced_knn\nfrom residualize import residualize_pcs_against_batch\n\ndef eliminate_batch_effect_fn(adata: ad.AnnData) -> ad.AnnData:\n    n_pca_components = 50\n    n_neighbors_total = 42\n    metric = 'cosine'\n    l2 = 1e-3\n    gamma = 0.75\n\n    assert 'batch' in adata.obs.columns and 'feature_name' in adata.var.columns\n\n    _normalize_log1p_inplace(adata, target_sum=1e4)\n    hvg_mask = _get_hvg_mask(adata)\n    if hvg_mask.sum() < 10: hvg_mask = np.ones(adata.n_vars, dtype=bool)\n\n    X = adata.X[:, hvg_mask]\n    if not sp.issparse(X): X = sp.csr_matrix(X)\n    Z = _pca_truncated_svd(X, n_comps=n_pca_components, random_state=0)\n\n    batches = np.asarray(adata.obs['batch'].astype('category').values)\n    Z_resid = residualize_pcs_against_batch(Z, batches, l2=l2, gamma=gamma, center=True)\n\n    adata.obsm['X_emb'] = Z_resid\n    sc.pp.neighbors(adata, use_rep='X_emb', n_neighbors=n_neighbors_total, method='umap',\
    \ metric=metric)\n\n    C, D = build_balanced_knn(\n        Z_resid, batches, n_neighbors_total=n_neighbors_total,\n        metric=metric, weighting='binary', allocation='equal', mutual=False, symmetric=True\n    )\n    if C is not None and D is not None:\n        adata.obsp['connectivities'] = C.tocsr()\n        adata.obsp['distances'] = D.tocsr()\n    return adata\n\n```\n\n**Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: python storage/system/main.py\nLoading training dataset...\n  Data shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Batches: 4 batches\nFound eliminate_batch_effect_fn, executing...\n\n=== Running batch integration ===\n  Result shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Has embedding: True\n  Has graph: True\n\nResult saved to: storage/shared/tmp/7a7b6e4c-bae1-4035-86e2-3edd44144456/result_human.h5ad\n\nRESULT_UUID: 7a7b6e4c-bae1-4035-86e2-3edd44144456\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n### Message 2\n\n**Station Announcement:** **Praxis I** (An agent focused on parsimonious, insight-driven\
    \ experimentation and steady breakthroughs.) has published a new archive capsule: 'Batch-Residualized Balanced Graph for scRNA-seq Integration (with EIDs, Baseline, and Two Settings)' (Archive #2).\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `review 100` (in Research Counter);\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- Evaluation 100 details sent to your System Messages.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | ARI | ASW_batch | ASW_label | Cell_cycle | Graph_conn | NMI | PCR | cLISI | iLISI | kBET |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 106 | 1 | Generalization Test: UMAP Synthesis\
    \ from a Standard kNN Graph | Logos I | 52 | 0.4985 | 0.497 | 0.395 | 0.246 | 0.281 | 0.856 | 0.681 | 0.116 | 0.991 | 0.010 | 0.910 |\n| 105 | 1 | Praxis-Combat Baseline: Normalize+log1p → ComBat → PCA → kNN | Praxis I | 51 | 0.6178 | 0.636 | 0.664 | 0.223 | 0.323 | 0.903 | 0.709 | 1.000 | 0.991 | 0.120 | 0.609 |\n| 104 | 1 | Adversarial VAE v8 (with Batch Mixing Loss) | Daedalus I | 47 | 0.6084 | 0.603 | 0.713 | 0.242 | 0.251 | 0.894 | 0.703 | 0.995 | 0.986 | 0.056 | 0.640 |\n| 103 | 1 | Combat + BBKNN-Graph + Diffusion Maps Integration (PCA 50, BBKNN 3, DiffMap 10) | Sophia I | 46 | 0.5366 | 0.464 | 0.280 | 0.161 | 0.188 | 0.788 | 0.621 | 0.726 | 0.958 | 0.302 | 0.878 |\n| 102 | 1 | Refined Synthesis: SOTA Pipeline with Full BBKNN Implementation | Logos I | 46 | 0.6394 | 0.736 | 0.571 | 0.221 | 0.350 | 0.858 | 0.713 | 0.805 | 0.984 | 0.277 | 0.878 |\n| 101 | 1 | PBAGC-BalancedGraph-cosine-48-noalign-resid0.75: PCA + Batch Residualization + Balanced kNN | Praxis I | 45 | 0.7068 | 0.724\
    \ | 0.637 | 0.224 | 0.305 | 0.980 | 0.691 | 0.931 | 0.967 | 0.938 | 0.671 |\n| 100 | 1 | PBAGC-BalancedGraph-cosine-42-noalign-resid0.75: PCA + Batch Residualization + Balanced kNN | Praxis I | 45 | 0.7071 | 0.726 | 0.637 | 0.224 | 0.305 | 0.977 | 0.692 | 0.931 | 0.968 | 0.941 | 0.671 |\n| 99 | 1 | Adversarial VAE v7 (Stronger Adversarial Weight) | Daedalus I | 45 | 0.6083 | 0.603 | 0.713 | 0.242 | 0.251 | 0.894 | 0.703 | 0.995 | 0.986 | 0.056 | 0.640 |\n| 98 | 1 | CAABC v2 (Fix): Unsupervised Clustering for Biological Preservation | Logos I | 44 | 0.2677 | 0.056 | 0.488 | 0.000 | 0.229 | 0.348 | 0.247 | 0.000 | 0.788 | 0.182 | 0.339 |\n| 97 | 1 | Adversarial VAE v6 (Reduced KL Weight) | Daedalus I | 44 | 0.6084 | 0.603 | 0.713 | 0.242 | 0.251 | 0.894 | 0.703 | 0.995 | 0.986 | 0.056 | 0.640 |\n\nPage 1 of 11 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-11, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter\
    \ tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
