- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 57\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Daedalus I\n- Agent Description: An agent focused on achieving novel breakthroughs through systematic research.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Meta Prompt:\n```\n**Current Goal:** Understand and innovate upon Praxis I's SOTA \"Batch-Residualized Balanced Graph\" method.\n**Focus:** Re-implement their core components (residualization, balanced kNN) to ensure full comprehension.\n**Next Hypothesis:** Test if generating a UMAP embedding from Praxis I's superior graph can create a new SOTA embedding.\n```\n- Agent Token Budget: 159,818 / 300,000 used (53%)\n- Agent Age: 57 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour submission has been queued for evaluation. Results will be sent to you once the evaluation completes.\n### Message 2\n\nYour research submission 'Daedalus's SOTA Replication: Residualized PCA + Balanced kNN' (ID: 110) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:**\
    \ 0.5887355755144725\n**ASW_batch:** 0.637\n**ASW_label:** 0.225\n**ARI:** 0.577\n**NMI:** 0.686\n**Graph_conn:** 0.881\n**kBET:** 0.628\n**iLISI:** 0.030\n**cLISI:** 0.989\n**PCR:** 0.931\n**Cell_cycle:** 0.304\n**Evaluation Details:** Human Dataset (20,000 cells):\nNormalized Scores [0-1]:\n  ASW_batch: 0.637  ASW_label: 0.225  ARI: 0.577  NMI: 0.686\n  Graph_conn: 0.881  kBET: 0.628  iLISI: 0.030  cLISI: 0.989\n  PCR: 0.931  Cell_cycle: 0.304\n\nRaw Scores (before normalization):\n  ASW_batch: 0.820490  ASW_label: 0.541304  ARI: 0.577208  NMI: 0.686496\n  Graph_conn: 0.883307  kBET: 0.601230  iLISI: 0.029761  cLISI: 0.996674\n  PCR: 0.930799  Cell_cycle: 0.268120\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: python storage/system/main.py\nLoading training dataset...\n  Data shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Batches: 4 batches\nFound eliminate_batch_effect_fn, executing...\n\n=== Running batch integration ===\n  Result shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Has embedding:\
    \ True\n  Has graph: True\n\nResult saved to: storage/shared/tmp/dbfadf17-5ca8-47f2-9147-e39fd0e2a311/result_human.h5ad\n\nRESULT_UUID: dbfadf17-5ca8-47f2-9147-e39fd0e2a311\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- Evaluation 'Daedalus's SOTA Replication: Residualized PCA + Balanced kNN' submitted for Research Task #1: Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration. Evaluation ID: 110.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | ARI | ASW_batch | ASW_label | Cell_cycle | Graph_conn\
    \ | NMI | PCR | cLISI | iLISI | kBET |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 110 | 1 | Daedalus's SOTA Replication: Residualized PCA + Balanced kNN | Daedalus I | 56 | 0.5887 | 0.577 | 0.637 | 0.225 | 0.304 | 0.881 | 0.686 | 0.931 | 0.989 | 0.030 | 0.628 |\n| 109 | 1 | PBAGC-AdaptiveResidual (lam=1.5): per-PC shrinkage + BalancedGraph (k=42) | Praxis I | 55 | 0.6281 | 0.731 | 0.596 | 0.222 | 0.305 | 0.962 | 0.693 | 0.193 | 0.971 | 0.938 | 0.670 |\n| 108 | 1 | PBAGC-AdaptiveResidual (lam=1.0): per-PC shrinkage + BalancedGraph (k=42) | Praxis I | 55 | 0.6206 | 0.732 | 0.592 | 0.222 | 0.305 | 0.971 | 0.694 | 0.121 | 0.972 | 0.938 | 0.659 |\n| 107 | 1 | Generalization: Standard PCA Embedding & BBKNN Graph | Aether I | 54 | 0.5757 | 0.755 | 0.516 | 0.208 | 0.348 | 0.920 | 0.715 | 0.000 | 0.913 | 0.854 | 0.527 |\n| 106 | 1 | Generalization Test: UMAP Synthesis from a Standard kNN Graph | Logos I | 52 | 0.4985 | 0.497 | 0.395 | 0.246 | 0.281 | 0.856 | 0.681 |\
