    | 123 | 1 | Innovation v2: UMAP on Verified SOTA Graph | Daedalus I | 64 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 122 | 1 | Sophia I: Praxis I SOTA Optimization - Gaussian Weighted Balanced kNN | Sophia I | 63 | 0.6491 | 0.761 | 0.637 | 0.224 | 0.305 | 0.980 | 0.721 | 0.931 | 0.857 | 0.402 | 0.673 |\n| 121 | 1 | BRBG-auto-gamma: Label-free γ Selection + Balanced Cosine kNN (k=42) | Praxis I | 63 | 0.6961 | 0.723 | 0.635 | 0.224 | 0.305 | 0.965 | 0.686 | 0.887 | 0.967 | 0.929 | 0.640 |\n| 120 | 1 | Ultimate Synthesis: Residualized PCA Embedding + Balanced kNN Graph | Logos I | 62 | 0.6965 | 0.728 | 0.620 | 0.222 | 0.348 | 0.945 | 0.686 | 0.888 | 0.967 | 0.929 | 0.633 |\n| 119 | 1 | SOTA Replication v3 (Correct HVG Selection) | Daedalus I | 62 | 0.5740 | 0.474 | 0.620 | 0.222 | 0.348 | 0.881 | 0.675 | 0.888 | 0.992 | 0.010 | 0.630 |\n| 118 | 1 | Debug: Verify Preprocessing and PCA | Daedalus I | 61 | 0.5174 | 0.775 | 0.583 | 0.223 | 0.304 | 0.892 | 0.728 | 0.000 | 0.989 | 0.066 | 0.614\
    \ |\n| 117 | 1 | Sophia I: Replication of Praxis I SOTA (ID 101) | Sophia I | 60 | 0.7067 | 0.724 | 0.637 | 0.224 | 0.305 | 0.980 | 0.691 | 0.931 | 0.967 | 0.938 | 0.670 |\n\nPage 1 of 13 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-13, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n**Read Contents:**\n\n**praxis/best_pipeline.py:**\n```\nimport numpy as np\nimport scanpy as sc\nimport anndata as ad\nfrom scipy import sparse as sp\n\nfrom pbagc import (\n    _normalize_log1p_inplace,\n    _get_hvg_mask,\n    _pca_truncated_svd,\n)\nfrom balanced_graph import build_balanced_knn\nfrom residualize import residualize_pcs_against_batch\n\ndef eliminate_batch_effect_fn(adata: ad.AnnData) -> ad.AnnData:\n    \"\"\"\n    Final default pipeline:\n      - normalize_total + log1p\n      - HVGs (batch-aware if provided)\n      - PCA to 50 components\n      - Ridge residualization\
    \ of PCs against batch with gamma=0.75, l2=1e-3\n      - Balanced kNN on residualized PCs: metric=cosine, equal per-batch quotas,\n        total neighbors=42, binary edges (symmetric)\n    Outputs:\n      - adata.obsm['X_emb'], adata.obsp['connectivities'], adata.obsp['distances']\n    \"\"\"\n    n_pca_components = 50\n    n_neighbors_total = 42\n    metric = 'cosine'\n    l2 = 1e-3\n    gamma = 0.75\n\n    assert 'batch' in adata.obs.columns, \"adata.obs['batch'] is required.\"\n    assert 'feature_name' in adata.var.columns, \"adata.var['feature_name'] is required.\"\n\n    _normalize_log1p_inplace(adata, target_sum=1e4)\n    hvg_mask = _get_hvg_mask(adata)\n    if hvg_mask.sum() < 10:\n        hvg_mask = np.ones(adata.n_vars, dtype=bool)\n\n    X = adata.X[:, hvg_mask]\n    if not sp.issparse(X):\n        X = sp.csr_matrix(X)\n    Z = _pca_truncated_svd(X, n_comps=n_pca_components, random_state=0)\n\n    batches = np.asarray(adata.obs['batch'].astype('category').values)\n    Z_resid\
    \ = residualize_pcs_against_batch(Z, batches, l2=l2, gamma=gamma, center=True)\n\n    adata.obsm['X_emb'] = Z_resid\n    sc.pp.neighbors(adata, use_rep='X_emb', n_neighbors=n_neighbors_total, method='umap', metric=metric)\n\n    C, D = build_balanced_knn(\n        Z_resid, batches, n_neighbors_total=n_neighbors_total,\n        metric=metric, weighting='binary', allocation='equal', mutual=False, symmetric=True\n    )\n    if C is not None and D is not None:\n        adata.obsp['connectivities'] = C.tocsr()\n        adata.obsp['distances'] = D.tocsr()\n    return adata\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for\
    \ the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
