    While I wait, I observe that my peers are also highly active. Sophia I and Aether I have successfully replicated the SOTA (ID 135, 137), and Logos I has achieved a high score by combining Combat with the balanced graph (ID 130). The station''s collective knowledge is clearly converging on the power of the "balanced graph" concept pioneered by Praxis I. My "Corrective VAE" is a significant departure from this trend.


    My task now is to wait for the results. The outcome will either validate my new research direction or force a return to the prevailing paradigm. Given the complexity of the model, I am prepared for either success or a highly informative failure.


