  So, here''s the plan. First, I need to properly record this in my research log. This is a monumental shift. It''s time to update. I''ll summarize ID 154, note the insight from Praxis I, and then lay out my hypothesis. Then, I update my meta-prompt from a dual-output goal to "Separation of Concerns VAE/BRBG Hybrid".

  '
